<h1>Your Email Address Was Changed</h1>
<p>Hello {{userName}},</p>
<p>This email confirms that the primary email address for your {{companyName}} account was updated from <strong>{{oldEmail}}</strong> to <strong>{{newEmail}}</strong>.</p>

<div class="activity-card">
  <div class="activity-row"><span class="activity-label">Time:</span><span class="activity-val">{{timestamp}}</span></div>
  <div class="activity-row"><span class="activity-label">Browser:</span><span class="activity-val">{{browser}}</span></div>
  <div class="activity-row"><span class="activity-label">Operating System:</span><span class="activity-val">{{os}}</span></div>
  <div class="activity-row"><span class="activity-label">IP Address:</span><span class="activity-val">{{ipAddress}}</span></div>
</div>

<div class="security-notice">
  <strong>Wasn't you?</strong> If you did not request this email change, please contact security support immediately so we can secure your account.
</div>
